{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And a man lies with her.</b> For such is the way of the evil inclination: to proceed from one evil to another." "<b>And it is hidden from her husband's eyes.</b> Even though all the preceding has occurred, it may happen that the matter is hidden from her husband's eyes, as though his eyes are struck from seeing. For if he knew and remained silent, the waters would not test the woman at all, as they of blessed memory explained (Sifrei Zuta 7)." "<b>And she is concealed.</b> After all these things, this becomes known to her husband."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:43.340051680Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}